        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-11T22:35:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Why, look over <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/store/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">here</a>!  In the <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/store/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Greater Than Games store</a>!</p>\n<p>There seems to be all sorts of new stuff!  I will be making a post on the main page later tonight, announcing that we now sell more stuff, like shirts and tracker cards, and that we’re ENTIRELY SOLD OUT OF SENTINELS OF THE MULTIVERSE!  HOW COOL IS THAT?!  The Scratch and Dent sale will just be to sell off the copies of the game we have that were damaged in transit.  The boxes of these games are dinged or smashed, but the cards inside are fine.  You’re still getting the complete game.  Just an ugly box.</p>\n<p>But!  The real reason I’m posting here first before posting on the main page is to let you fine forum folks have a shot at the two (2) - count 'em: 2 (two) - playmats we’re selling.  These are the same play mats we use at conventions.  We had a couple at PAX Prime last fall, and we had a couple at PAX East just last weekend.  They work GREAT and stand up to a LOT of usage.  However, we’re changing the design, so we’re selling off the last two we have.  Want a piece of Greater Than Games history?  This is the playmat for you.  Also, they’re rather handy.</p>\n<p>SO!  Go check out the <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/store/\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">store</a>!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:17.966Z",
